# AppPages — Agent Reference

> **Full architecture doc:** `docs/ARCHITECTURE.md` — comprehensive reference with data model, URL routing, security model, build pipeline, i18n, CI/CD, and future work. Read it for deep context; this file is a quick-reference summary.

## What is AppPages?

A multi-tenant web app for mobile publishers to generate and host public pages required by Google Play Console and App Store Connect: privacy policies, terms of use, support pages, account/data deletion pages, and marketing landing pages.

**Live URL:** https://armikom-app-pages.web.app
**GitHub:** https://github.com/armikom/apppages (public, `armikom` account)
**Firebase project:** `armikom-app-pages` (owner: `devops@armikom.com`)
