## Tech Stack

| Layer | Tech |
|-------|------|
| Monorepo | pnpm workspace (`packages/shared`, `functions`, `apps/dashboard`) |
| Dashboard | React 19 + Vite + Tailwind CSS 3 + React Router 7 + React Hook Form + Zod |
| Public pages | Cloud Functions v2 (Node 22) → server-rendered HTML, no JS required |
| Auth | Firebase Auth — Google sign-in only (Apple disabled, can be re-enabled) |
| Database | Cloud Firestore (eur3 region, native mode) |
| Storage | Cloud Storage (for app icons — needs manual init in console) |
| Shared | `@apppages/shared` — Zod schemas, TypeScript types, i18n (EN+TR), HTML templates |
| Tests | Vitest + @firebase/rules-unit-testing |
| CI/CD | GitHub Actions → Firebase deploy on push to `main` |

