## Data Model (Firestore)

```
users/{uid}                           → UserProfile (role, plan, defaultAccountId)
accounts/{accountId}                  → Account (tenant)
  /members/{uid}                      → AccountMember (role: owner|editor)
  /apps/{appId}                       → AppData (the main entity — all app config)
    /versions/{version}               → AppVersion (immutable publish snapshot)
    /requests/{requestId}             → PublicRequest (deletion/support form submissions)
  /publisherProfiles/{profileId}      → PublisherProfile (reusable across apps)
slugs/{slug}                          → { accountId, appId } (global uniqueness map)
abuseReports/{reportId}               → Admin-only
```

**Key rule:** Personal account ID === user's Firebase Auth UID. Team accounts (future) will use generated IDs.

## URL Map

### Dashboard (SPA routes — Firebase Hosting → index.html)
- `/login` — Google sign-in
- `/` — App list
- `/apps/new` — Create app wizard (7 steps)
- `/apps/:appId` — App detail + store links panel
- `/apps/:appId/inbox` — Manage deletion/support requests
- `/settings` — Profile, delete account

### Public Pages (Firebase Hosting rewrite → `publicPages` Cloud Function)
- `/p/{slug}` — Landing page with store badges
- `/p/{slug}/privacy` — Generated privacy policy
- `/p/{slug}/terms` — Terms of use / EULA
- `/p/{slug}/support` — Support page + optional contact form
- `/p/{slug}/delete-account` — Account deletion page + web form
- `/p/{slug}/delete-data` — Data deletion page (optional per app)
- `/p/{slug}/privacy/history` — Version history
- Language: `?lang=tr` or `/p/{slug}/tr/privacy`

### API (Firebase Hosting rewrite → `api` Cloud Function)
- `POST /api/request/{slug}` — Form submission (deletion/support)

