## Known Issues / TODOs

- **Firebase Storage** not initialized — needs manual "Get Started" click in Firebase Console → Storage, then `npx firebase deploy --only storage`
- **Apple sign-in** disabled (code removed from LoginPage) — re-enable when Apple Services ID is configured
- **Email confirmation** for deletion/support requests: the confirmation URL is logged to console but no email is actually sent. Need Trigger Email extension or SMTP integration
- **App Check / reCAPTCHA** not wired — honeypot + rate limiter provide basic bot protection
- **Global firebase CLI (v15)** crashes with SIGKILL 137 — always use `npx firebase` (v13 from devDeps)
- **Chunk size warning** in dashboard build (~907KB) — can be fixed with code-splitting via dynamic imports

## Out of Scope for v1
- Payments / billing (plan field exists, no Stripe integration)
- Custom domains per app
- Team invitations / multi-member accounts
- Languages beyond EN and TR
- Playwright e2e tests (directory exists, no tests written yet)
